OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few light
OL,6,Fshowers in the northwest at first.
OL,7,FOtherwise dry with increasing clear
OL,8,Fspells allowing a few fog patches to
OL,9,Fdevelop and a touch of rural frost in
OL,10,Fplaces.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA chilly start with a few fog
OL,13,Fpatches soon clearing. Otherwise dry
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells by day. Cloudier in
OL,15,Fthe evening with some patchy rain and
OL,16,Ffreshening southeast winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
