OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,FMonday with patchy rain. Overnight
OL,7,Frain soon clearing Tuesday then
OL,8,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,9,FWindy on Wednesday with bright spells,
OL,10,Fvariable cloud and some outbreaks of
OL,11,Frain.
